  "body": "The way I see it, it is perhaps simplistic: the minimum required CMake in the current ART's build configuration is 3.9. Github's CI certainly uses a fairly recent CMake. If this change works, without the need to increase the minimum required version, done.\n\nFor what is worth, I'm using the latest stable CMake version, 4.3, and there are no issues with the rest of the build. That is, the current CMakeLists.txt doesn't contain any instruction which has been deprecated since 3.9.",
